# Github Faves — local dev vars (DO NOT COMMIT real values)
# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in. Deploy value via: wrangler secret put GITHUB_TOKEN
#
# This is the only secret the app needs. There is no OAuth flow: a classic PAT
# with no scopes beyond public_repo works, and authentication to the app itself
# is handled by Cloudflare Access (see isAccessAuthenticated in src/worker.js).

# Required. Reads /user/starred + starredRepositories GraphQL + repositoryTopics.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional. Only needed for `wrangler d1` / `wrangler deploy` if you have not
# already run `wrangler login`.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=3e37b0a010de20bc7fc5b6c9d0dcb285
